          "items": [
            "Blue Sky Bungalow – A Luxurious 30A Vacation Rental in Inlet Beach | Golf Cart Perks<br><br>Experience the ultimate 30A getaway at Blue Sky Bungalow, a stunning luxury vacation rental in Inlet Beach. Located in the sought-after Grande Pointe community, this beautifully designed home offers breathtaking Gulf views from the 3rd floor, a resort-style pool, and quick access to Inlet Beach’s pristine shores. With spacious open-concept living, a gourmet kitchen, and multiple outdoor spaces, this retreat is perfect for family gatherings and coastal relaxation. Explore Rosemary Beach, Alys Beach, and Seacrest Beach with five included bikes, or unwind by the pool overlooking the serene Lake Powell. Whether you're soaking up the sun, dining al fresco, or cruising along Scenic Highway 30A, Blue Sky Bungalow offers the perfect blend of luxury and adventure.",
